'''Commander Anarileth''' is a [[high elf]] [[quest giver]] located in [[Brinthilien]] in the [[Thalassian Highlands]]. She is a ranger of the [[Silvermoon Remnant]] who was tasked by the [[Regency Council]] with providing sustenance and shelter for all those who seek refuge in the Highlands.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|1|Provisions for Refugees}}</ref>

